            <ArticleTitle>Comprehensive care of musical hands.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>505-11</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Hand pain is the most common complaint among musicians, and it can have devastating effects on careers and, therefore, incomes. An understanding of the artist's mindset, playing techniques, and goals is invaluable in the management of this unique patient.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
